  "Description": "perl-DBI\n[1.641-10]\n- Fix number of tests\n  Resolves: RHEL-247869\n\n[1.641-9]\n- Fix placeholder limit on :N and :pN style placeholders (CVE-2026-73194)\n  Resolves: RHEL-247869\n\n[1.641-8]\n- Fix unsafe string eval in DBI::Profile (CVE-2026-14380)\n  Resolves: RHEL-211151\n\n[1.641-7]\n- Fix patch.\n\n[1.641-6]\n- Fix heap overflow when preparsing SQL statements with excessive placeholders (CVE-2026-14739)\n  Resolves: RHEL-193298\n\n[1.641-5]\n- Fix stack overflow and buffer overflow in DBI.xs (CVE-2026-9698)\n  Resolves: RHEL-184974\n\n[1.641-4]\n- BR: perl(blib), perl(FileHandle) for tests\n\n[1.641-3]\n- Rebuild with enable hardening (bug #1636329)\n\n[1.641-2]\n- Rebuilding for multicontext errata test purposes (rhbz#1666480)\n\n[1.641-1]\n- 1.641 bump\n\nperl-DBI\n[1.641-10]\n- Fix number of tests\n  Resolves: RHEL-247869\n\n[1.641-9]\n- Fix placeholder limit on :N and :pN style placeholders (CVE-2026-73194)\n  Resolves: RHEL-247869\n\n[1.641-8]\n- Fix unsafe string eval in DBI::Profile (CVE-2026-14380)\n  Resolves: RHEL-211151\n\n[1.641-7]\n- Fix patch.\n\n[1.641-6]\n- Fix heap overflow when preparsing SQL statements with excessive placeholders (CVE-2026-14739)\n  Resolves: RHEL-193298\n\n[1.641-5]\n- Fix stack overflow and buffer overflow in DBI.xs (CVE-2026-9698)\n  Resolves: RHEL-184974\n\n[1.641-4]\n- BR: perl(blib), perl(FileHandle) for tests\n\n[1.641-3]\n- Rebuild with enable hardening (bug #1636329)\n\n[1.641-2]\n- Rebuilding for multicontext errata test purposes (rhbz#1666480)\n\n[1.641-1]\n- 1.641 bump",
